ng of the Dustchpost River, rarely used since the drying up of local trade."},{"icon":"glyph-1f309","type":"bridges","px":14,"x":1149.55,"y":516.21,"cell":2859,"i":9,"name":"Chiazuzak Bridge","note":"A weathered bridge spans over the Chiazuzak Fork near Ras'tur."},{"icon":"glyph-1f37b","type":"inns","px":14,"x":881.76,"y":436.88,"cell":2127,"i":10,"name":"The Distant Inn","note":"A big and famous roadside inn. Delicious jugged bear with brown nectar is served here."},{"icon":"glyph-1f37b","type":"inns","px":14,"x":640.2,"y":526.44,"cell":2940,"i":11,"name":"The Grey Marten","note":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious roasted pasta with sparkling cider is served here."},{"icon":"glyph-1f37b","type":"inns","px":14,"x":1552.52,"y":394.05,"cell":1803,"i":12,"name":"The High Tavern","note":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious pan-fried beaver with sour rum is served here."},{"icon":"glyph-1f37b","type":"inns","px":14,"x":1395.71,"y":545.51,"cell":3109,"i":13,"name":"The Loud Hare","note":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious boiled pottage with amber mead is served here."},{"icon":"glyph-1f37b","type":"inns","px":14,"x":353.51,"y":275.67,"cell":612,"i":14,"name":"The Fat Falcon","note":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious grilled potato with orange whisky is served here."},{"icon":"glyph-1f37b","type":"inns","px":14,"x":209.12,"y":593.08,"cell":3459,"i":15,"name":"The Brave Inn","note":"A big and famous roadside inn. Delicious baked peas with smelly sap is served here."},{"icon":"glyph-1f37b","type":"inns","px":14,"x":1523.36,"y":361.43,"cell":1413,"i":16,"name":"The Superior Inn","note":"A big and famous roadside inn. Delicious cured badger with ice absinthe is served here."},{"icon":"glyph-1f37b","type":"inns","px":14,"x":1168.48,"y":522.71,"cell":2860,"i":17,"name":"The Loud Crow","note":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious corned sturgeon with yellow absinthe is served here."},{"icon":"glyph-1f37b","type":"inns","px":14,"x":844,"y":309.2,"cell":857,"i":18,"name":"The Dark Boar","note":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious cured boar with salty juice is served here."},{"icon":"glyph-1f37b","type":"inns","px":14,"x":1160.34,"y":648.36,"cell":4041,"i":19,"name":"The Purple Mantis","note":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious roasted chicken with sparkling wine is served here."},{"icon":"glyph-1f37b","type":"inns","px":14,"x":575.82,"y":296.4,"cell":836,"i":20,"name":"The Frozen Crow","note":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious syrupped chevon with pink kvass is served here."},{"icon":"glyph-1f6a8","type":"lighthouses","px":14,"x":662.79,"y":646.07,"cell":3991,"i":21,"name":"Kizan Lighthouse","note":"A lighthouse to serve as a beacon for ships in the open sea."},{"icon":"glyph-2694-fe0f","type":"battlefields","dy":52,"x":802.87,"y":617.21,"cell":3624,"i":22,"name":"Khundush Battlefield","note":"A historical battle of the Narakhath War. \r\nDate: July 10, 314 Mermouth Era."},{"icon":"glyph-2694-fe0f","type":"battlefields","dy":52,"x":1468.25,"y":493.46,"cell":2650,"i":23,"name":"Falefairun Battlefield","note":"A historical battle of the Gloman War. \r\nDate: January 3, 551 Mermouth Era."},{"icon":"glyph-2694-fe0f","type":"battlefields","dy":52,"x":1535.47,"y":476.2,"cell":2532,"i":24,"name":"Eagrove Battlefield","note":"A historical battle of the Lialan Invasion. \r\nDate: March 11, 552 Mermouth Era."},{"icon":"glyph-2694-fe0f","type":"battlefields","dy":52,"x":527.41,"y":427.78,"cell":1983,"i":25,"name":"Rozzuz Battlefield","note":"A historical battle of the Krakan Conquest. \r\nDate: September 15, 402 Mermouth Era."},{"icon":"glyph-1f5dd-fe0f","type":"dungeons","dy":51,"px":13,"x":894.65,"y":747.98,"cell":4778,"i":26,"name":"Dungeon","note":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=7079670464778\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=7079670464778\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5dd-fe0f","type":"dungeons","dy":51,"px":13,"x":904.71,"y":774,"cell":4984,"i":27,"name":"Dungeon","note":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=7079670464984\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=7079670464984\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5dd-fe0f","type":"dungeons","dy":51,"px":13,"x":583.67,"y":248.31,"cell":477,"i":28,"name":"Dungeon","note":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=707967046477\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=707967046477\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f409","type":"lake-monsters","dy":48,"x":907.32,"y":652.76,"cell":4015,"i":29,"name":"Nikanarjas Monster","note":"Locals say a relic monster of 12 ft long inhabits Nikanarjas Lake. Truth or lie, folks are afraid to fish in the lake."},{"icon":"glyph-1f991","type":"sea-monsters","x":434.2,"y":176.3,"cell":111,"i":30,"name":"Oakwar Monster","note":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 21 ft long."},{"icon":"glyph-1f479","type":"hill-monsters","dy":54,"px":13,"x":1389.16,"y":461.37,"cell":2399,"i":31,"name":"Chia Dragon","note":"Tales speak of a horrifying Dragon who inhabits Chia hills and harasses travelers in the area."},{"icon":"glyph-1f333","type":"sacred-forests","x":1422.11,"y":343.12,"cell":1279,"i":32,"name":"Qhai Forest","note":"A forest sacred to local Simehalerism."},{"icon":"glyph-1f333","type":"sacred-forests","x":1481.74,"y":648.32,"cell":4065,"i":33,"name":"Westleneld Forest","note":"A forest sacred to local Simehalerism."},{"icon":"glyph-1f332","type":"sacred-pineries","px":13,"x":1339.04,"y":749.12,"cell":4826,"i":34,"name":"Dewgbureshi Pinery","note":"A pinery sacred to local Simehalerism."},{"icon":"glyph-1f4b0","type":"brigands","px":13,"x":1589.16,"y":446.82,"cell":2298,"i":35,"name":"Westhgrose Boars","note":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"icon":"glyph-1f4b0","type":"brigands","px":13,"x":1129.95,"y":383.19,"cell":1639,"i":36,"name":"Zhoch Rooks","note":"A gang of forest highwaymen."},{"icon":"glyph-1f4b0","type":"brigands","px":13,"x":246.02,"y":605.95,"cell":3582,"i":37,"name":"Kuzggor Leopards","note":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3f4-200d-2620-fe0f","type":"pirates","dx":51,"x":963.9,"y":540.5,"cell":2963,"i":38,"name":"Pirates","note":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3f4-200d-2620-fe0f","type":"pirates","dx":51,"x":197.48,"y":481.26,"cell":2431,"i":39,"name":"Pirates","note":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":635.24,"y":356.68,"cell":1345,"i":40,"name":"Bulbredh Monolith","note":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᢟᠼᠳ᠑᠀ᡕᠯᠳᠰᠯ᠀ᠻᠮᢋᡱᠡᡓᠱᢥᢞᡭᡲᢑ᠑ᠪ᠒ᡳᡍᠱᡲᢋ᠐ᡲᢐᡮᠪᢂᡭᠰᡝᡭᡙᢥ᠒ᡏᠿᠮᡰᡀᡲᡗᠾᡠᠯᠡᠯᠮᢂᡓᠮᡮᡴ᠒ᡱᡖᠼᡆᡖᡴᠮᠡ᠀ᠽᠼᡁ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1147.49,"y":682.56,"cell":4278,"i":41,"name":"Lial Stele","note":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡑᢟᢥᡆᢓᠨ᠒ᠧ᠑ᡐᡯᢒᡟᡰᠼᡆᢛᠳᠻᢤ᠒ᡡᠽᢒᡕᢓᢀᠡᢐᡭᢟᡱᡝᡝᢞᠧᡟᢑᡔ᠐᠒ᡁᠡᡠᢒᡭᡒ᠑ᡁᢓᠱᠿᡮᠽᠰᡆᢏᠾᡝᡀᠠᡯ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1539.76,"y":650.89,"cell":4069,"i":42,"name":"Cryshell Pillar","note":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳔⳚⳄⳈⳖⲶⳊⳫⳞⲲⳌⳁⳠⳌⳌⲾⳘ⳥ ⳩ⲸⳊⳊ ⳾ⲴⳃⳆⳌⳲⳂⳀⳃ  ⳾ⲸⲲⳭⳬⳭ⳥⳾⳪Ⳙ  ⳘⳒⳄⲲⲾⳔ⳥ⳞⳭ ⳹Ⲿ ⲾⳭ⳥Ⳇⳁ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":1460.41,"y":407.22,"cell":1924,"i":43,"name":"Ruined Castle","note":"Ruins of an ancient castle. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":1421.93,"y":298.24,"cell":897,"i":44,"name":"Ruined Sacred site","note":"Ruins of an ancient sacred site. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":525.07,"y":434.03,"cell":2101,"i":45,"name":"Ruined Fort","note":"Ruins of an ancient fort. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":1214.39,"y":554.6,"cell":3208,"i":46,"name":"Ruined Fortification","note":"Ruins of an ancient fortification. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f4da","type":"libraries","x":764.34,"y":601.42,"cell":3502,"i":47,"name":"Giragz Library","note":"A vast collection of knowledge, including many rare and ancient tomes."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3aa","type":"circuses","x":796.49,"y":311.19,"cell":980,"i":48,"name":"Travelling Fantastical Circus","note":"Roll up, roll up, this fantastical circus is here for a limited time only."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3aa","type":"circuses","x":781.58,"y":635.17,"cell":3753,"i":49,"name":"Travelling World-famous Circus","note":"Roll up, roll up, this world-famous circus is here for a limited time only."},{"icon":"glyph-1f93a","type":"jousts","dx":48,"x":670.79,"y":512.53,"cell":2824,"i":50,"name":"Sku'tak Contest","note":"Warriors from around the land gather for a contest of acumen in Sku'tak, with fame, fortune and favour on offer to the victor."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3a0","type":"fairs","x":899.96,"y":411.61,"cell":1884,"i":51,"name":"Naj'jaz Fair","note":"A fair is being held in Naj'jaz, offering local amber, ships, and vinegar alongside foreign goods and services."},{"icon":"glyph-1f6f6","type":"canoes","x":588.76,"y":372.51,"cell":1468,"i":52,"name":"Minor Jetty","note":"A small location along the Vazon River to launch boats from sits here, along with a weary looking owner, willing to sell passage along the river."},{"icon":"glyph-1f417","type":"migration","x":1247.44,"y":774.13,"cell":5010,"i":53,"name":"Bears migration","note":"A huge group of bears are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"icon":"glyph-1f987","type":"caves","x":1285.78,"y":572.12,"cell":3320,"i":54,"name":"Hesee Ravine","note":"The Hesee Ravine. Locals claim that it is totally empty."},{"icon":"glyph-1f300","type":"portals","px":14,"x":570.37,"y":451.11,"cell":2225,"i":55,"name":"Rraj'iress Portal","note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major cities. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"glyph-1f300","type":"portals","px":14,"x":626.63,"y":287.85,"cell":727,"i":56,"name":"Risuna Portal","note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major cities. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"glyph-1f300","type":"portals","px":14,"x":980.07,"y":580.36,"cell":3298,"i":57,"name":"Sie Portal","note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major cities. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"glyph-1f300","type":"portals","px":14,"x":301.68,"y":322.63,"cell":1071,"i":58,"name":"Aykut Portal","note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major cities. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"glyph-1f300","type":"portals","px":14,"x":624.88,"y":399.21,"cell":1736,"i":59,"name":"Ma'kan'ji Portal","note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major cities. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"glyph-1f300","type":"portals","px":14,"x":767.4,"y":267.61,"cell":566,"i":60,"name":"Palas Portal","note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major cities. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"glyph-1f300","type":"portals","px":14,"x":394.44,"y":689.13,"cell":4332,"i":61,"name":"Dharud Portal","note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major cities. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"glyph-1f300","type":"portals","px":14,"x":1547.46,"y":576.54,"cell":3339,"i":62,"name":"Litfal Portal","note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major cities. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"glyph-1f300","type":"portals","px":14,"x":733.04,"y":717.34,"cell":4563,"i":63,"name":"Kinulb Portal","note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major cities. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"glyph-1f300","type":"portals","px":14,"x":1616.71,"y":468.81,"cell":2416,"i":64,"name":"Steamberg Portal","note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major cities. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"glyph-1f386","type":"rifts","x":489.76,"y":567.2,"cell":3262,"i":65,"name":"Demonic Rift","note":"A rumoured demonic rift in this area is causing swarms of foes to spill forth."},{"icon":"glyph-1f480","type":"disturbed-burials","x":1483.63,"y":479.21,"cell":2528,"i":66,"name":"Disturbed Burial","note":"A burial site has been disturbed in this area, causing the dead to rise and attack the living."},{"icon":"glyph-1f480","type":"disturbed-burials","x":693.9,"y":558.94,"cell":3169,"i":67,"name":"Disturbed Burial","note":"A burial site has been disturbed in this area, causing the dead to rise and attack the living."},{"icon":"glyph-1faa6","type":"necropolises","x":723.25,"y":179.27,"cell":191,"i":68,"name":"Skalluph Crypt","note":"This cursed necropolis is veiled in perpetual twilight, perpetuating a sense of impending doom. Dark enchantments shroud the tombs, and the moans of anguished souls resound through its crumbling halls."},{"icon":"glyph-1f9d9","type":"encounters","x":1550.71,"y":480.86,"cell":2533,"i":69,"name":"Random encounter","note":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/2533\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f9d9","type":"encounters","x":437.5,"y":665.11,"cell":4091,"i":70,"name":"Random encounter","note":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/4091\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f9d9","type":"encounters","x":401.88,"y":394.14,"cell":1719,"i":71,"name":"Random encounter","note":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/1719\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f9d9","type":"encounters","x":1410.47,"y":713.41,"cell":4621,"i":72,"name":"Random encounter","note":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/4621\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f9d9","type":"encounters","x":184.5,"y":418.7,"cell":1831,"i":73,"name":"Random encounter","note":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/1831\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f9d9","type":"encounters","x":1417.14,"y":511.46,"cell":2879,"i":74,"name":"Random encounter","note":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/2879\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f9d9","type":"encounters","x":657.41,"y":561.69,"cell":3166,"i":75,"name":"Random encounter","note":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/3166\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"><